- Upstream: <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness>, pinned at `dsh-v0.2.1-rc.3` (`1f81c047fc48fa190a683e469daa699857e9afe8`).
- Upstream paths:
  - `.agents/skills/dsh-find-simplifications/SKILL.md` — the procedure: scope and constraints, the discovery questions, reachability and trade-off proof, ownership and failure semantics, infrastructure replacement, and the record workflow.
